      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "想象你听说海边洞穴里可能有 pirates 留下的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 6.302,
      "end": 16.265,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "现在又有一台新机器，名字叫"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Revealer"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，好像能把地下隐藏的东西"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "出来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 16.615,
      "end": 21.071,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这听起来像"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "treasure dream almost came true"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 21.421,
      "end": 30.237,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是这篇课文的笑点在落差：大家很兴奋，最后只找到一枚"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "almost worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的小金币。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 30.587,
      "end": 36.243,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天先记住这条线："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "big dream, small result, still hopeful"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 36.593,
      "end": 39.513,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一段，先看为什么大家会期待宝藏。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 39.862,
      "end": 51.782,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：寻找失踪宝藏的梦想最近差点成真，因为一台叫 The Revealer 的新机器已经被发明出来，并被用来探测地下埋藏的黄金。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 52.132,
      "end": 57.82,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文开头说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dreams of finding lost treasure almost came true recently"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 58.17,
      "end": 64.562,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dreams of finding lost treasure"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是大期待，像一个寻宝梦突然快要成真。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 64.912,
      "end": 70.968,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "期待为什么会变高？因为："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A new machine called 'The Revealer' has been invented"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 71.318,
      "end": 81.406,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Called 'The Revealer'"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "给机器起了一个很戏剧化的名字。它来自"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，意思是 show something hidden。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 81.755,
      "end": 87.563,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这台机器已经被用来做什么？"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "to detect gold which has been buried in the ground"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 87.913,
      "end": 94.881,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Detect"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是发现不容易看见的东西；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "buried"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是埋在地下。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 95.231,
      "end": 103.831,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以第一段先记中文：宝藏梦差点成真，新机器被发明，机器能探测地下黄金。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 104.181,
      "end": 108.821,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二段，海边洞穴和海盗传说把期待继续推高。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 109.171,
      "end": 120.411,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：这台机器被用在海边附近的一个洞穴里。据说海盗过去常在那里藏金子，他们常把金子埋在洞里，却没能取走。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 120.76,
      "end": 125.132,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The machine was used in a cave near the seashore"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 125.482,
      "end": 134.122,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Seashore"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是海边，配上"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "cave"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，画面马上像老故事里的藏宝地点。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 134.472,
      "end": 141.368,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但别把它讲成海盗知识课。课文只说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "where -- it is said -- pirates used to hide gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 141.718,
      "end": 147.942,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示“据说”，它可能是传说，也可能是人们听来的说法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 148.291,
      "end": 154.995,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Used to hide gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "讲过去常有的情况，不是说现在还有海盗在那里。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 155.345,
      "end": 161.177,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The pirates would often bury gold in the cave and then fail to collect it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 161.527,
      "end": 169.575,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Would often"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示过去反复做；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "fail to collect it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是最后没能把金子取走。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 169.925,
      "end": 177.045,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以第二段中文线是：海边洞穴，据说海盗过去藏金子，而且常常埋下后没有取走。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 177.394,
      "end": 181.314,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三段，机器信号出现，大家兴奋开挖。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 181.664,
      "end": 194.384,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：探宝队带着新机器进洞，希望找到埋藏的宝藏；队长检查洞口附近的土壤时，机器显示地下有金子，于是大家兴奋地挖了两英尺深。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 194.734,
      "end": 199.874,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Armed with the new machine, a search party went into the cave"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 200.224,
      "end": 207.844,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "armed with"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是“拿着武器”，而是 equipped with，带着这台新机器。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 208.194,
      "end": 214.634,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A search party"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "也不是庆祝派对，而是一组搜索的人，探宝队。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 214.984,
      "end": 219.663,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他们进洞的目的很清楚："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "hoping to find buried treasure"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 220.013,
      "end": 226.653,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后关键动作来了："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The leader of the party was examining the soil near the entrance to the cave"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 227.003,
      "end": 232.947,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Soil"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是土壤；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "entrance to the cave"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是洞口。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 233.297,
      "end": 238.609,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "正在检查的时候，机器显示："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "there was gold under the ground"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 238.959,
      "end": 244.998,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "期待到达最高点："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Very excited, the party dug a hole two feet deep"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 245.348,
      "end": 253.14,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "源数据里这一处有一个拼写问题；标准英语是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "two feet deep"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，两英尺深。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 253.49,
      "end": 256.93,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四段，结果很小，但希望还在。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 257.28,
      "end": 272.2,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：他们最后只找到一枚几乎不值钱的小金币；接着彻底搜遍整个洞穴，也只发现一个空铁皮箱。尽管如此，人们仍相信机器很快会发现有价值的东西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 272.55,
      "end": 276.514,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "They finally found a small gold coin"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 276.864,
      "end": 286.279,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Finally found"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "听起来像努力之后终于有结果，可结果马上反转："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "which was almost worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 286.629,
      "end": 294.685,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Almost worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是“完全没有意义”，而是几乎没有价值。和前面的 treasure dream 形成落差。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 295.035,
      "end": 300.515,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他们没有马上放弃，又继续："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "searched the whole cave thoroughly"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 300.865,
      "end": 304.737,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Thoroughly"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是彻底地、仔细地。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 305.087,
      "end": 310.071,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可最后："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "did not find anything except an empty tin trunk"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 310.42,
      "end": 315.996,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Except"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "让结果更失望：除了一个空铁皮箱，什么也没有。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 316.346,
      "end": 321.378,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后一句很有意思："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of this, many people are confident"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 321.728,
      "end": 334.4,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of this"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的意思是“尽管结果这么让人失望”，人们还是相信机器"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "may reveal something of value fairly soon"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 334.75,
      "end": 343.694,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这就是题目"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Not a gold mine"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的反讽：不是完全没有金子，而是不是能发财的大金矿。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 344.043,
      "end": 350.714,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，标题"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Not a gold mine"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是不是说洞里一点金子都没有？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 351.063,
      "end": 360.959,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。洞里确实有一枚小金币，但它"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "almost worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。标题的意思是：这不是一个能让人发财的 gold mine。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 361.309,
      "end": 364.632,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以笑点是期待很大，结果很小？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 364.982,
      "end": 376.962,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Lost treasure"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "、新机器、海边洞穴、海盗传说，都把期待推得很高。最后只有一枚小金币和一个空铁皮箱，这就是 irony。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 377.312,
      "end": 381.25,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Revealer"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么叫这个名字？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 381.6,
      "end": 390.412,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是 show something hidden，显示隐藏的东西。这个名字本身就很会制造期待。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 390.762,
      "end": 396.702,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Detect"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "有什么区别？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 397.052,
      "end": 409.716,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Detect"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是发现或探测到不容易看见的东西；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是把隐藏的东西显示出来。机器先 detect gold，然后好像要 reveal treasure。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 410.066,
      "end": 413.806,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Party"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在这里不是生日派对？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 414.156,
      "end": 422.676,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。这里"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a search party"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是 a group of people searching，搜索队或探宝队。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 423.026,
      "end": 427.486,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Armed with the new machine"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "会不会让人想到武器？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 427.836,
      "end": 434.396,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里不要按武器理解。意思是他们 equipped with the new machine，也就是带着这台机器进洞。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 434.746,
      "end": 437.804,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "海盗和洞穴会不会讲得很吓人？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "start": 438.154,
      "end": 448.634,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不会。Pirates 只是背景传说：老故事里海盗会把 treasure 藏在海边或洞穴里。现实里洞穴和挖掘都需要专业人员和安全许可。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "start": 448.983,
      "end": 451.234,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "背这篇要先背什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 451.584,
      "end": 474.704,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先背中文寻宝反讽线：宝藏梦差点成真 -> 新机器能探测埋藏黄金 -> 海边洞穴据说有海盗藏宝 -> 探宝队进洞 -> 机器显示有金子 -> 大家兴奋开挖 -> 只找到几乎不值钱的小金币 -> 又搜到空铁皮箱 -> 仍然相信机器以后会找到值钱东西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 475.054,
      "end": 479.038,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dreams of finding lost treasure almost came true recently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 479.387,
      "end": 485.987,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A new machine called 'The Revealer' has been invented and it has been used to detect gold which has been buried in the ground."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "start": 486.337,
      "end": 491.617,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The machine was used in a cave near the seashore where -- it is said -- pirates used to hide gold."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "start": 491.967,
      "end": 496.431,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The pirates would often bury gold in the cave and then fail to collect it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "start": 496.781,
      "end": 502.277,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Armed with the new machine, a search party went into the cave hoping to find buried treasure."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "start": 502.627,
      "end": 509.779,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The leader of the party was examining the soil near the entrance to the cave when the machine showed that there was gold under the ground."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 510.129,
      "end": 514.017,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Very excited, the party dug a hole two feet deep."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 70,
      "start": 514.367,
      "end": 518.591,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "They finally found a small gold coin which was almost worthless."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 71,
      "start": 518.941,
      "end": 524.749,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The party then searched the whole cave thoroughly but did not find anything except an empty tin trunk."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 72,
      "start": 525.098,
      "end": 531.338,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of this, many people are confident that 'The Revealer' may reveal something of value fairly soon."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 73,
      "start": 531.688,
      "end": 534.4,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reveal"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一个词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 74,
      "start": 534.75,
      "end": 536.454,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reveal"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 75,
      "start": 536.804,
      "end": 543.116,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reveal"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Reveal"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "means show something that was hidden，显示隐藏的东西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 76,
      "start": 543.466,
      "end": 550.198,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reveal"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这课的机器叫"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Revealer"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，意思就是“能把隐藏东西显示出来的机器”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 77,
      "start": 550.548,
      "end": 555.219,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reveal"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文最后说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "may reveal something of value fairly soon"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 78,
      "start": 555.569,
      "end": 564.769,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reveal"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个词把希望留到最后：虽然这次只找到小金币，大家还相信机器可能会 reveal 更有价值的东西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 79,
      "start": 565.119,
      "end": 567.871,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "detect"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二个词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "detect"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
