      "start": 597.952,
      "end": 599.704,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "worthless"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 87,
      "start": 600.054,
      "end": 603.566,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "worthless"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是几乎没有价值的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 88,
      "start": 603.915,
      "end": 608.311,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "worthless"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a small gold coin which was almost worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 89,
      "start": 608.661,
      "end": 614.581,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "worthless"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意这里不是说 coin 没有任何意义，而是说它没有大家想象中 treasure 的价值。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 90,
      "start": 614.931,
      "end": 621.571,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "worthless"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个词就是整篇的反讽核心：big treasure dream，small almost worthless result。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 91,
      "start": 621.921,
      "end": 627.585,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "grammar board"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "叫：机器、传说和落差。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 92,
      "start": 627.935,
      "end": 632.175,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一块是被动语态，特别适合机器和发现故事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 93,
      "start": 632.525,
      "end": 642.144,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A new machine has been invented"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "it has been used to detect gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "gold has been buried in the ground"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 94,
      "start": 642.494,
      "end": 648.414,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意重点不是谁发明、谁使用，而是机器被发明、被使用，金子被埋藏。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 95,
      "start": 648.764,
      "end": 654.404,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二块是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "called"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A new machine called 'The Revealer'"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 96,
      "start": 654.754,
      "end": 661.778,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Called"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后面给出名字。这个名字来自 reveal，所以特别会制造期待。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 97,
      "start": 662.128,
      "end": 670.691,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三块是过去习惯："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "pirates used to hide gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The pirates would often bury gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 98,
      "start": 671.041,
      "end": 677.241,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它们都在讲过去传说里反复发生的事，不是在讲现在还有海盗这样做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 99,
      "start": 677.591,
      "end": 685.799,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四块是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was doing when"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The leader was examining the soil when the machine showed that there was gold"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 100,
      "start": 686.149,
      "end": 691.509,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "一个动作正在进行，关键事件突然发生，期待被推到最高。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 101,
      "start": 691.859,
      "end": 698.938,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第五块是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "except"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "did not find anything except an empty tin trunk"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 102,
      "start": 699.288,
      "end": 704.248,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这句话把失望感说得很清楚：除了空箱子，什么也没找到。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 103,
      "start": 704.598,
      "end": 707.958,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后一块是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of this"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 104,
      "start": 708.308,
      "end": 714.188,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它的结构可以记成：bad result plus in spite of this plus continued hope。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 105,
      "start": 714.538,
      "end": 722.058,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这课里就是：结果很小，但很多人仍然 confident，仍然相信机器可能找到 something of value。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 106,
      "start": 722.408,
      "end": 728.952,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "现在把今天的寻宝反讽放进安全的生活场景："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Old Box Search"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 107,
      "start": 729.302,
      "end": 734.222,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你在家里发现一个旧铁盒，以为里面可能有很值钱的东西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 108,
      "start": 734.571,
      "end": 739.723,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先说期待："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Dreams of finding lost treasure almost came true"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 109,
      "start": 740.073,
      "end": 744.657,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "再说地点："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I found an old tin box in the cupboard"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 110,
      "start": 745.007,
      "end": 751.151,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你可以用手电筒认真检查："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I used a flashlight to detect something inside it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 111,
      "start": 751.501,
      "end": 757.213,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结果出来前，你很兴奋："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Very excited, I opened the box"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 112,
      "start": 757.563,
      "end": 762.483,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结果却很小："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "I finally found a small game coin"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 113,
      "start": 762.832,
      "end": 766.496,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "评价落差："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It was almost worthless"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 114,
      "start": 766.846,
      "end": 774.638,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后用转折保留希望："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of this, I am still confident that I may find something of value one day"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 115,
      "start": 774.988,
      "end": 783.228,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "下面练习里，你要用这些词组把一个“期待很大、结果很小、但还抱有希望”的 old box story 补完整。"
        }
      ]
    },
